## FlightSimExpo 2026 Announcement ✈️

I’ll be attending **FlightSimExpo 2026**, one of the biggest events in **the world of flight simulation**.

🗓️ **June 12–14, 2026**  
📍 Saint Paul RiverCentre, Saint Paul, Minnesota

---

This event brings together developers, hardware manufacturers, and the global simulation community for a weekend focused on innovation, technology, and aviation passion.

We will be covering the event across our social media with:
- Live updates  
- Behind-the-scenes content  
- New simulation technologies, developments, and hardware  
- Community coverage from the event  

